"Icing","type":{"id":"516","text":"Stoppage","abbreviation":"stoppage"},"clock":{"displayValue":"1:50"},"period":{"number":1,"displayValue":"1st"}},{"id":"401892740000000760","scoringPlay":false,"scoreValue":0,"awayScore":0,"homeScore":0,"text":"Phillip Danault faceoff won against Evan Rodrigues","type":{"id":"502","text":"Face Off","abbreviation":"faceoff"},"clock":{"displayValue":"1:50"},"period":{"number":1,"displayValue":"1st"},"team":{"id":"10"},"participants":[{"athlete":{"id":"2562602","displayName":"Phillip Danault","shortName":"P. Danault"},"type":"face-off-winner"},{"athlete":{"id":"3648008","displayName":"Evan Rodrigues","shortName":"E. Rodrigues"}}]},{"id":"401892740000000800","scoringPlay":false,"scoreValue":0,"awayScore":0,"homeScore":0,"text":"Arber Xhekaj shot blocked by Stefan Noesen","type":{"id":"508","text":"Blocked","abbreviation":"shot-blocked"},"clock":{"displayValue":"1:52"},"period":{"number":1,"displayValue":"1st"},"team":{"id":"11"},"participants":[{"athlete":{"id":"4893969","displayName":"Arber Xhekaj","shortName":"A. Xhekaj"},"type":"shooter"},{"athlete":{"id":"2562623","displayName":"Stefan Noesen","shortName":"S. Noesen"},"type":"defender"}]},{"id":"401892740000001040","scoringPlay":false,"scoreValue":0,"awayScore":0,"homeScore":0,"text":"Cody Glass hit Adam Engstrom","type":{"id":"503","text":"Hit","abbreviation":"hit"},"clock":{"displayValue":"2:24"},"period":{"number":1,"displayValue":"1st"},"team":{"id":"11"},"participants":[{"athlete":{"id":"4233568","displayName":"Cody Glass","shortName":"C. Glass"},"type":"hit-credited"},{"athlete":{"id":"5188450","displayName":"Adam Engstrom","shortName":"A. Engstrom"},"type":"hitted"}]}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"1826","fullName":"Prudential Center","address":{"city":"Newark","state":"NJ","zipCode":"07199","country":"USA"},"grass":false,"images":[{"href":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/venues/nhl/day/1826.jpg","width":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day"]}]},"attendance":16514,"officials":[{"fullName":"Jean Hebert","displayName":"Jean Hebert","position":{"name":"Referee","displayName":"Referee","id":"24"},"order":0},{"fullName":"Tommy Hughes","displayName":"Tommy Hughes","position":{"name":"Linesman","displayName":"Linesman","id":"25"},"order":0},{"fullName":"Justin Kea","displayName":"Justin Kea","position":{"name":"Referee","displayName":"Referee","id":"24"},"order":0},{"fullName":"Kilian McNamara","displayName":"Kilian McNamara","position":{"name":"Linesman","displayName":"Linesman","id":"25"},"order":0}]},"article":{"headline":"Canadiens end power-play drought and hand Connor Hellebuyck his 1st Devils loss with 3-2 victory","description":"— Jake Evans scored the go-ahead goal, captain Nick Suzuki ended his team's long power-play drought and the Montreal Canadiens defeated the New Jersey Devils 3-2 on Wednesday night to halt a two-game skid.","story":"NEWARK, N.J. -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4393049/jake-evans\">Jake Evans</a> scored the go-ahead goal, captain <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4233594/nick-suzuki\">Nick Suzuki</a> ended his team's long power-play drought and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/mtl/montreal-canadiens\">Montreal Canadiens</a> defeated the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/nj/new-jersey-devils\">New Jersey Devils</a> 3-2 on Wednesday night to halt a two-game skid.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3020225/connor-hellebuyck\">Connor Hellebuyck</a> got a piece of Evans' shot with his glove but could not keep it out of the net. The goal with 13:43 left sparked “Go, Habs, go!” chants from the many Canadiens fans in attendance. \n\n\r\n              Hellebuyck allowed three goals on 27 shots and lost for the first time in eight starts since joining New Jersey in <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/hellebuyck-trade-devils-jets-26c70cac1b23930670e1200f298ac80e?cache\">a trade from Winnipeg</a> in late October. \n\n\r\n              Despite <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3899978/timo-meier\">Timo Meier</a> setting up a goal by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4697446/luke-evangelista\">Luke Evangelista</a> and scoring on a breakaway fresh out of the penalty box, the Devils had their two-game winning streak snapped, losing for just the second time in their past nine. \n\n\r\n              The Canadiens only trailed for 40 seconds after Evangelista's goal, as <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4565237/alex-newhook\">Alex Newhook</a> got in on net and made a nifty move to beat Hellebuyck and tie it. After spending time practicing the power play on Tuesday and devoting significant conversation to what was going wrong, they came up empty on their first two chances.\n\n\r\n              With Montreal's run at 0 for its past 14, a parade to the penalty box eventually came back to bite New Jersey. Suzuki drew a tripping penalty on <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2554903/brenden-dillon\">Brenden Dillon</a>, then deflected <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5080230/lane-hutson\">Lane Hutson</a>'s point shot in past Hellebuyck with 41.9 seconds remaining in the first period.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5188437/jacob-fowler\">Jacob Fowler</a> stopped all 20 shots he faced in the second and third, finishing with 27 saves and avoiding what would have been his first time losing consecutive games this season. He and his teammates successfully killed a penalty in the final minutes to seal it.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Canadiens: <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4697686/jakub-dobes\">Jakub Dobes</a> is set to start in net at defending champion Carolina on Thursday night in the second half of a back-to-back.\n\n\r\n              Devils: Visit the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/stl/st-louis-blues\">St. Louis Blues</a> on Saturday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-11-19T03:27:34Z"}}